1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,278
Day 3 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,618 --> 00:00:04,595
31 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,595 --> 00:00:06,492
…11 of them just say
"The"!

4
00:00:06,492 --> 00:00:09,540
Thanks Mats,
that's still €22!

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,741
Yesterday: 66 residents.

6
00:00:12,741 --> 00:00:14,707
Today, we are 89!

7
00:00:15,047 --> 00:00:18,906
That brings
€23,079 into the budget!

8
00:00:19,246 --> 00:00:21,665
MegaYanti gets
a house!

9
00:00:22,005 --> 00:00:23,948
Thomas gets
a bungalow!

10
00:00:24,305 --> 00:00:26,039
Niky gets
a mansion!

11
00:00:26,605 --> 00:00:29,408
Mats asked for
a robot as a house…

12
00:00:29,408 --> 00:00:31,502
Beep boop, welcome home!

13
00:00:31,842 --> 00:00:34,122
Bread asked for
a nuclear bunker…

14
00:00:34,122 --> 00:00:35,551
Built to last!

15
00:00:35,891 --> 00:00:40,561
UserFromRO, Salih and cnaaitsirh:
your homes come next!

16
00:00:40,901 --> 00:00:43,019
TJ moves in
with Joe!

17
00:00:43,019 --> 00:00:45,275
By the way, TJ
is a rat!

18
00:00:45,615 --> 00:00:49,809
UserFromRO, Salih and 15 more
move into the apartment block!

19
00:00:50,149 --> 00:00:52,986
Not14redmi wished for
a water pump…

20
00:00:52,986 --> 00:00:54,952
No more buckets for Leo!

21
00:00:55,292 --> 00:00:57,642
Principal Banana makes promises!

22
00:00:57,642 --> 00:00:59,736
Install water fountains!

23
00:00:59,736 --> 00:01:02,341
…and give free food every day (bananas)!

24
00:01:02,681 --> 00:01:06,563
illegal football player and Alex
want to be president too!

25
00:01:06,563 --> 00:01:09,029
The election has
4 candidates now!

26
00:01:09,029 --> 00:01:12,121
No votes yet:
reply with a name to vote!

27
00:01:12,461 --> 00:01:14,003
And what do you
want next?

28
00:01:14,003 --> 00:01:15,830
The school is in the lead!

29
00:01:16,170 --> 00:01:19,470
The school costs
€120,000.

30
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:21,785
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

31
00:01:21,785 --> 00:01:24,262
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

32
00:01:24,602 --> 00:01:26,263
Who should lead
Leoville?

33
00:01:26,263 --> 00:01:28,043
Vote in the
comments!
